  {
    "id": 2002013010040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー、今いいでしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030020010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　いいよ\r\nどうした、何かあったか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0454"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ、すみません\r\n全然仕事の話ではないんですが……",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい、雑談……というか",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、じゃあそんなにかしこまらなくていいよ\r\nどんな話だ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ああ……ええと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "とても個人的なのですが、\r\n聞いてみたいことがありまして",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん？　俺に？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……プロデューサーって、\r\nどんな景色がお好きですか？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "景色か",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\n灯織がアイドルをしている時かな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……気障ですね、ものすごく",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうかな\r\nでも嘘でもなんでもないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "好きなんだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織が頑張ってる姿とか、\r\nその頑張りが実を結んでいるところを見るのが",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺はこのために仕事してるんだって感じるというか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ええと、その\r\nありがとうございます……が合っているんでしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "反応の正解がわからないのですが……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私が考えていた景色とは少し違う気がしますね……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、あれ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "景色ってそういうことじゃないのか！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……そういうこと……なんでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あのさ、灯織\r\n俺からもちょっと聞いていいか",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "これって\r\n心理テストとか？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "別の答えの方がいいかな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "俺に聞いた理由\r\nなんだけど",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010180,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "えっ\r\nあ、いえ……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "すみません、全然違うんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "その……よく見ている占いサイトで\r\n『好きな景色を写真に撮ると良い』とあって",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "綺麗だなと思う景色はあるのですが、\r\n自分の好きな景色ってよくわからないなと思って",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーは\r\nどういうところを好きだと思うのかなと",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……すみません\r\n先にこの話をするべきでした",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010230"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺の答えって、\r\n灯織が聞きたかったことと違うんだよな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ええと……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "すみません、自分でもどういう回答を期待していたか\r\nと言われると、あまりわからなくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "占いで『好きな景色』と書いてあったんです\r\n綺麗な景色ではなく",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "綺麗だなと思う景色はあるのですが\r\n好きな景色というと、なんだかピンと来なくて",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010280,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーの『私がアイドルをしている時』も\r\n確かにそうだなと感じていて……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織は、何を知りたいと思ったんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010290,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そう……ですね\r\n景色がどうこう、というよりも……──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010300,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "好きと思う理由……を\r\n知りたかったのかもしれません",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010310,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "理由……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう\r\nたぶん何かきっかけがあるんだよな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010320,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ……はい",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010330,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『好きな景色をたくさん見つけると良い』\r\n『写真に撮って飾ったりスマホの壁紙にするともっと良い』",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010340,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そう書いてあって",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それは占い？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010350,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010360,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "風景の写真集を持っているんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010360"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010370,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "どれも綺麗だなという感想は持つのですが\r\nじゃあどこが好きなのかと言われるとちょっと……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201301/2002013010370"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013010380,
